# DESK06 run A -- File -> Execute EmuCON on the bare desktop: the console takes
# the whole screen, two commands are typed into it, `exit` brings the desktop
# back.
#
#   File drop-down (serial `[desk06] FILEBOX#11=(64,19,184,240)`):
#     entries are 16 px tall, rel y 0..224; ENTRY13 "Execute EmuCON  ^Z"
#     rel y=208 -> abs 227..243, centre 235.  Box x 64..248.
#   Hovering a title opens its drop-down (no click), as in DESK03..DESK05.
#   IKBD scancodes: v 2F, e 12, r 13, d 20, i 17, x 2D, t 14, Return 1C
#   (break = make | 0x80).
100 parkbr
300 move 600 240
1000 arm
1200 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 88 8
2200 mark B_FILEMENU
2500 move 120 235
2700 down
2703 up
3800 mark C_CONSOLE
4000 key 2f
4030 key af
4060 key 12
4090 key 92
4120 key 13
4150 key 93
4200 key 1c
4230 key 9c
4800 mark D_VER
5000 key 20
5030 key a0
5060 key 17
5090 key 97
5120 key 13
5150 key 93
5200 key 1c
5230 key 9c
5900 mark E_DIR
6100 key 12
